---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { analytics } from '../data/analytics';


// Fires only when the reader arrived here from a real MailerLite signup on
// this site (sessionStorage.rgh_signup_pending, set by FunnelGuards). Direct
// visits and reloads do not count as signups.
const adsId = /^AW-[0-9]+$/i.test(analytics.adsId.trim()) ? analytics.adsId.trim() : '';
const adsLabel = analytics.adsSignupLabel.trim();
const sendTo = adsId && adsLabel ? `${adsId}/${adsLabel}` : '';
const thanksJs = `(function(){var src='';try{src=sessionStorage.getItem('rgh_signup_pending')||'';}catch(e){}if(!src)return;try{sessionStorage.removeItem('rgh_signup_pending');sessionStorage.setItem('rgh_signup_done','1');}catch(e){}function go(){if(typeof gtag!=='function')return;gtag('event','email_signup',{method:'mailerlite',signup_source:src});${sendTo ? `gtag('event','conversion',{send_to:'${sendTo}'});` : ''}}go();})();`;
---
<Base title="Thank you — here's your printable guide | ReadyGearHub" description="Thanks for signing up for ReadyGearHub's storm-readiness reminders. Your printable winter storm checklist is ready." noindex>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h1>Thank you — here's your guide</h1>
      <p class="lead">We're glad you're here. Your printable checklist is ready below, no strings attached.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="wrap section prose">
    <p><a class="btn" href="/downloads/winter-storm-ready-checklist.pdf" download>Download the Winter Storm Ready Checklist (PDF)</a></p>
    <p class="fine">Six printable pages: before the storm, the kit, during an outage, after the storm, and an emergency contacts page for the fridge.</p>
    <p>Two more short printables, also free, if you'd like something to tape inside a cabinet door:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="/downloads/fridge-freezer-food-safety-chart.pdf" download>Fridge &amp; Freezer Outage Food-Safety Chart</a> (1 page, from FoodSafety.gov, the FDA, and the CDC)</li>
      <li><a href="/downloads/emergency-contacts-shutoffs-sheet.pdf" download>Emergency Contacts &amp; Shut-Offs Quick Sheet</a> (2 fillable pages for numbers and shut-off locations)</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>One quick step</h2>
    <p>MailerLite will send you a short confirmation email. Tap the button in it so our occasional storm-readiness reminders reach you. If you don't see it in a few minutes, check your spam or promotions folder.</p>

    <div class="thanks-steps">
      <article class="card">
        <h2>Fridge &amp; freezer quick reference</h2>
        <p>Worth taping inside a cabinet door. Per FoodSafety.gov:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>A closed refrigerator keeps food cold for about <strong>4 hours</strong>.</li>
          <li>A full freezer holds for about <strong>48 hours</strong> (about 24 if half full) with the door closed.</li>
          <li>Toss perishables that sat above 40°F for 2 hours or more. When in doubt, throw it out.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="fine"><a href="/downloads/fridge-freezer-food-safety-chart.pdf" download>Download the 1-page chart (PDF)</a> · <a href="/tools/outage-timer/">Outage timer</a> · <a href="/apps/cold-hold/">Cold Hold</a> (free, works offline)</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <h2>Emergency contacts, written down</h2>
        <p>Phones die in long outages. Fill in page 6 of the checklist with a few key numbers and post it on the fridge:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>An out-of-town contact everyone checks in with</li>
          <li>Doctors, pharmacy, and your power company's outage line</li>
          <li>Poison Help: 1-800-222-1222</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="fine"><a href="/downloads/emergency-contacts-shutoffs-sheet.pdf" download>Download the 2-page contacts &amp; shut-offs sheet (PDF)</a> · <a href="/apps/all-accounted/">All Accounted</a> (free household board, works offline)</p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <h2>If you'd like to go further</h2>
    <p>Everything above is yours to keep. You can also use the free <a href="/tools/kit-builder/">kit builder</a>, <a href="/tools/water-calculator/">water calculator</a>, and the <a href="/apps/">offline apps</a>.</p>
    <p class="fine">You can unsubscribe from any email with one click. We never sell or share your address. <a href="/privacy/">Privacy</a></p>
  </section>
</Base>
<script is:inline set:html={thanksJs}></script>
